<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>in my arms</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Artemas</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">LOVERCORE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5MyK3yVqENRiFaZ9G59GTs</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.060" end="00:06.500">The more we touch, the more I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.500" end="00:08.960">That I could never let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.960" end="00:13.230">In my arms is where you belong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.230" end="00:15.660">And I know that you feel ashamed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.660" end="00:17.890">That you keep crawling back again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.890" end="00:23.300">But in my arms is where you belong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.300" end="00:27.000">I know I'm leading you astray</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.000" end="00:31.980">Causing you much pain, loving you this way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.980" end="00:35.830">And I know that I should let you be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.830" end="00:38.110">You tell me you're happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.110" end="00:41.370">Well, babe, I don't believe you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.370" end="00:44.930">Oh, oh, I can't help it either way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.930" end="00:50.070">If it was such a sin, it wouldn't feel this great</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.070" end="00:54.120">And oh, oh, I just love the way you taste</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.120" end="00:56.310">From your cherry lips</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.310" end="00:58.500">To your little waist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.500" end="01:00.830">The more we touch, the more I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.830" end="01:03.240">That I could never let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.240" end="01:07.570">In my arms is where you belong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.570" end="01:09.870">And I know that you feel ashamed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.870" end="01:12.250">That you keep crawling back again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.250" end="01:16.730">But in my arms is where you belong</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.730" end="01:18.230">I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.550" end="01:19.750">Don't you forget</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.750" end="01:22.030">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.030" end="01:24.330">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.330" end="01:26.580">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.580" end="01:28.830">Don't you forget</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.830" end="01:31.080">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.080" end="01:33.260">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.260" end="01:34.760">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.020" end="01:36.340">And they can hear me crying</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.340" end="01:38.580">All around the world</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.580" end="01:40.930">From the English countryside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.930" end="01:42.930">To the underworld</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.930" end="01:45.280">So don't you think of leaving</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.280" end="01:47.690">'Cause you belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.690" end="01:49.930">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.930" end="01:53.650">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.650" end="01:55.910">Don't you forget</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.910" end="01:58.260">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.260" end="02:00.460">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.460" end="02:02.780">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.780" end="02:04.950">Don't you forget</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.950" end="02:07.160">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.160" end="02:09.480">You belong to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.480" end="02:13.480">You belong to me</p></div></body></tt>